OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stole ambulance with
OL,4,Apatient inside jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 32-year-old appeared at
OL,7,FStoke-on-Trent Crown Court after
OL,8,Fpreviously admitting false imprisonment
OL,9,Fand aggravated vehicle taking following
OL,10,Fthe theft on 25 March.
